<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../../partials/platform/head.ejs', {
      title: "Smart Decisions: free help with career, insurance, property and tech | JobsDoor360",
      description: "Four free tools that help you decide: which stream or career suits you, what insurance you need, whether a property price is fair, and which tech expert to hire.",
      canonical: "https://jobsdoor360.in/smart-decisions/",
    }) -%>
  </head>
  <body class="sd-body" data-ga-module="smart_decisions">
    <%- include('../../partials/platform/navbar.ejs', { path: "/smart-decisions/" }) -%>
    <main id="main">
      <header class="sd-hero" data-ga-section="hero">
        <div class="sd-wrap">
          <nav class="sd-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-ga-section="breadcrumb"><a href="/" data-ga-event="nav_click" data-ga-name="breadcrumb_home">Home</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page" style="opacity:1;margin:0">Smart Decisions</span></nav>
          <span class="sd-pill">FREE TO START · STRAIGHT ANSWERS</span>
          <h1>Smart Decisions</h1>
          <p>Big choices get easier when someone gives you a straight answer. Pick what's on your mind and answer a few questions. It's free, and nobody will try to sell you anything.</p>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="sd-wrap sd-section" data-ga-section="modules">
        <div class="sd-grid sd-lift">
          <a class="sd-card" href="/smart-decisions/career/" data-ga-name="hub_card_career">
            <div class="sd-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <span class="sd-tag free">Free quiz · 3 min</span>
            <h2 class="h3" style="font-size:1.12rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--sd-navy);margin-bottom:6px">Career decisions</h2>
            <p>Stuck between streams or careers? Five questions and you'll have a direction to start from.</p>
            <span class="sd-go">Find my direction →</span>
          </a>
          <a class="sd-card" href="/smart-decisions/insurance/" data-ga-name="hub_card_insurance">
            <div class="sd-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <span class="sd-tag free">Free check · 1 min</span>
            <h2 class="h3" style="font-size:1.12rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--sd-navy);margin-bottom:6px">Insurance</h2>
            <p>Find out which cover you actually need (health, term, motor) before anyone tries to sell you one.</p>
            <span class="sd-go">Check what I need →</span>
          </a>
          <a class="sd-card" href="/smart-decisions/investment/" data-ga-name="hub_card_investment">
            <div class="sd-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-building" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <span class="sd-tag free">Free snapshot</span>
            <h2 class="h3" style="font-size:1.12rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--sd-navy);margin-bottom:6px">Property investment</h2>
            <p>Thinking of buying a flat? Get an honest price picture for your city before a broker gets to you.</p>
            <span class="sd-go">Check prices →</span>
          </a>
          <a class="sd-card" href="/smart-decisions/it-help/" data-ga-name="hub_card_it_help">
            <div class="sd-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <span class="sd-tag free">Free · 4 questions</span>
            <h2 class="h3" style="font-size:1.12rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--sd-navy);margin-bottom:6px">IT help</h2>
            <p>Website broken or building something new? Find out which kind of expert to hire.</p>
            <span class="sd-go">Find out who I need →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <section class="sd-wrap" style="padding-bottom: 20px" data-ga-section="how_it_works">
        <h2 class="sd-section-title">How it works</h2>
        <p class="sd-section-sub">Same simple pattern everywhere.</p>
        <div class="jd-steps">
          <div class="jd-step"><h3>Answer a few questions</h3><p>No sign-up, no phone number. Most take under five minutes.</p></div>
          <div class="jd-step"><h3>Get a clear answer</h3><p>A plain explanation of what fits you and why, free.</p></div>
          <div class="jd-step"><h3>Go deeper only if you want</h3><p>Detailed reports and expert calls are optional, and the price is always shown first.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="sd-wrap sd-section" data-ga-section="findme_prompt">
        <div class="sd-handoff" style="text-align:center;font-size:1.02rem">
          Not sure which one to pick? <a href="/findme/" data-ga-name="hub_findme_prompt">Take the 5-minute Findme quiz →</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('../../partials/platform/footer.ejs') -%>
  </body>
</html>
